    "caption": "If you’re grilling meats at home, or just have a craving for potatoes, we strongly recommend making these Honey Butter Hasselback Potatoes made with Capilano Pure Honey.\n\nThe technique that goes into making these potatoes might seem daunting, but it’s actually pretty simple to execute. Slathered with honey, butter, garlic, lemon, and parsley, these are great to pair with any protein or even to enjoy on its own! Head over to #TheMarketplace today and get all the ingredients you need!\n\nServing Time: 1 hour\nYield: 10 pieces\n\nIngredients\n\n10 pcs. Medium-sized potatoes\n¼ cup olive oil\nSalt and pepper to taste\n¼ cup butter\n5 cloves garlic, minced \n½ cup Capilano Pure Honey\n1 tbsp. lemon juice \n2 tbsps. parsley, chopped\n\nProcedure\n\n1. Preheat oven to 200C. \n2. Make cuts across the width of each potato 1 mm apart, making sure not to slice all the way into the flesh. Transfer into a lined baking tray, then coat with olive oil, and season with salt and pepper. \n3. Roast for 45-50 minutes, or until potatoes are golden and cooked through. \n4. Sauté garlic in butter until lightly toasted. Mix in Capilano Pure Honey and lemon juice. \n5. Coat roasted hasselback potatoes with the honey butter sauce, then garnish with parsley. \n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
