    "caption": "There’s nothing like coming home to a hearty and delicious meal, and for a pasta dish that nourishes the soul, try this Kale & Sausage Penne made with San Remo Penne.\n\nItalian sausage provides that spicy, meaty kick, while kale adds color and more nutrition to this dish. A spritz of lemon ties up everything together. Have this for dinner tonight and head over to #TheMarketplace to shop all the items you need for this dish!\n\nServing Time: 40 minutes\nYield: 4-6 servings\n\nIngredients\n\n3 tbsps. olive oil \n1 white onion, diced \n5 cloves garlic, minced \n1 tbsp. chili flakes\n400g Italian sausage, casings removed and crumbled \n1 cup chicken stock\n4 cups kale, tough parts removed \n1 (500g) pack San Remo Penne, boiled according to package instructions\n1 cup parmesan cheese, grated\nSalt and pepper to taste\n\nProcedure\n\n1. In a large pan, sauté onions and garlic until soft. Mix in chili flakes and Italian sausages. Cook until sausages are nicely browned, then set aside. \n2. In the same pan, add chicken stock, then scrape off brown bits. Bring stock to a boil, then add in kale and let soften. \n3. Mix in cooked San Remo Penne, parmesan cheese and the reserved Italian sausages. Season with salt and pepper to taste. \n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
