    "caption": "As Filipinos, we’re so used to enjoying corned beef with rice and potatoes, so this time around, why not try these Corned Beef Sandwiches made with Woolworths Corned Beef!\n\nHailing from Australia, Woolworths Corned Beef is briny, meaty, and packed with so much flavor. Pair with mayonnaise, cheddar cheese, garlic, and pickles and sandwich in between slices of sourdough.\n\nFind Woolworths Corned Beef, along with other Woolworths products, exclusively at #TheMarketplace!\n\nServing Time: 15 minutes\nYield: 2 servings\n\nIngredients\n\n¼ cup olive oil\n4 slices sourdough bread \n1 can Woolworths Corned Beef, sliced\n¼ cup mayonnaise\n1 clove garlic, grated\nSalt and pepper to taste\n6 pcs. pickle slices\n4 pcs. sandwich cheddar cheese slices\n\nProcedure\n\n1. Brush sourdough slices with 2 tbsps. olive oil, then toast until crisp. \n2. Fry Woolworths Corned Beef in remaining olive oil until nicely browned on both sides. \n3. Combine mayonnaise and garlic, then season with salt and pepper.\n4. To assemble, spread some garlic mayonnaise on each bread slice. Fill each sandwich with pickle slices, corned beef and cheese.\n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
